e.v6":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/4","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v6","seojin.appearance.hair.v6","seojin.appearance.costume.v6","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v6"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.negative_space.v6","statement":"캐릭터 내부의 바탕과 여백이 주된 면적을 차지하고 피부·머리·복식·갑옷 어느 영역도 균일하거나 불투명하게 완전 채워지지 않아야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.open_contour.v6":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/1","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v6","seojin.appearance.costume.v6"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.open_contour.v6","statement":"빠르게 그린 동양 애니메이션 원화와 수묵 스케치처럼 예상 외곽·내부 경계의 35–45%를 의도적으로 생략하고, 모든 팔다리·옷·실루엣의 양쪽 선을 닫지 않아야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.pigment_application.v6":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/6","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v6","seojin.appearance.materials.v6"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.pigment_application.v6","statement":"제한 안료는 목깃, 한쪽 어깨 갑옷, 허리, 한쪽 옷자락과 환도 손잡이를 우선하며 translucent uneven watercolor bleed, soft pastel rub 또는 briefly dragged brush mark로 적용하고 약간의 선 밖 번짐과 mark 내부 여백을 허용해야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.pigment_budget.v6":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/5","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v6","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v6"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.pigment_budget.v6","statement":"faded indigo/navy와 dusty ochre/gray-brown 정확히 두 accent hue 계열만 4–7개의 local marks로 사용하고 전체 pigment coverage는 캐릭터 면적의 18% 이하여야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.pose_frame.v6":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/9","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v6","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v6"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.pose_frame.v6","statement":"자연스러운 front three-quarter의 중립이지만 즉시 움직일 수 있는 전신 자세를 한 viewpoint로만 사용하고 머리부터 발끝까지 crop 없이 보여야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.proportion.v6":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/0","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v6"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.proportion.v6","statement":"전신은 3.75–4.25 heads이고 머리 높이는 24–27%이며 팔다리는 짧고 단순해야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.stroke_character.v6":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/2","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v6","seojin.appearance.materials.v6"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.stroke_character.v6","statement":"선은 가변 압력, 마른 붓 끊김, taper와 occasional doubled searching stroke를 사용하고 보조 복식선은 옅은 회색의 끊긴 선 또는 완전 생략이어야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.specification.v6":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/singleImageSpecification","value":{"anchor":{"groundContactAxis":"horizontal normalized line from (0.25,0.92) to (0.75,0.92)","pelvisOrRootPoint":"normalized canvas point (0.5,0.55)","type":"pelvis_root_ground_axis"},"canvas":{"height":1536,"width":1024},"finalBackgroundPolicy":"transparent","framing":"centered full-body head-to-toe with generous clear space; no crop","generationBackground":{"color":"#F2EFE6","mode":"removable_solid"},"noShadow":true,"outline":{"enabled":false},"pose":"neutral but ready-to-move full-body stance; right hand lightly at the sheathed hwando grip on the left hip","safeArea":"left 96 px, right 96 px, top 96 px, bottom 128 px; the complete subject must remain inside all four insets","targetDisplaySize":{"height":144,"width":96},"viewpoint":"natural front three-quarter view, one approved viewpoint only"}}},"schemaVersion":"character_visual_design_decision_v1"}
